"Terackerins are gill-less aquatic animals with dark blue backs, catfish-like heads and paddle fins."
"They have long, firm, sharp whiskers; some lineages are bred to enjoy company and grow bus-sized."
"On 'Bloat' a terackerin swells a translucent electric-blue layer on its back for riders."
"New riders put a hand in the water so it learns their smell; a scent peg dropped in calls it."
"Terackerin riding is an antiquated local hobby near Rapport III."
